warning[use_after_free]: storage ends while a started borrower may still access it; shortest retained-borrow path shown (0 other bad paths from this start)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/tasks.jai:34:5
   |
29 |     p := make();
   |          ------ borrowed storage originated here
   ...
33 |     start(*job);
   |     ----------- borrower started here; no completion on this path
34 |     release(p);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: wait for successful borrower completion before releasing captured storage
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

warning[use_after_free]: this starts a borrower with storage whose lifetime has already ended
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/tasks.jai:44:5
   |
39 |     p := make();
   |          ------ borrowed storage originated here
   ...
44 |     start(*job);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: start and finish the borrower before releasing its storage
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

warning[returned_local_address]: storage ends while a started borrower may still retain its receiver; shortest retained-borrow path shown (0 other bad paths from this start)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/tasks.jai:48:23
   |
48 | bad_receiver_scope :: () {
   |                       ^^
   ...
